  3
NTROLS MEASURES ARE PROVIDED IN THE ASBESTOS MANAGEMENT PLAN FOLDER OR ON CONNECT.\P\PNON ARQIVA EMPLOYEES MUST CONSULT WITH THEIR OWN COMPANY TO DETERMINE HOW TO WORK WITH ASBESTOS CONTAINING MATERIAL.\P\P\C1;PLEASE NOTE UNLESS A FULL REFURBISHMENT 
  3
SURVEY HAS BEEN UNDERTAKEN, THERE WILL BE AREAS OF THE BUILDING WHERE THE SURVEYOR HAS BEEN UNABLE TO ACCESS.\~ EXAMPLES OF THESE ARE; UNDERNEATH FLOORBOARDS, ABOVE SEALED SUSPENDED CEILINGS, CONCEALED AREAS WITHIN THE BUILDING FABRIC, CAVITY WALLS, 
  1
PLASTER COVERED ASBESTOS BOARDS, PLASTERED COATINGS APPLIED TO WALLS, FLANGE GASKETS, COMPRESSION GASKETS AND PLUGGING AND FILLING MATERIALS CONTAINING ASBESTOS.}
