SCHEDULE OF CONTRACTORS WORKS:-\P\P1. "BEFORE ANY EXCAVATION WORKS TAKE PLACE, THE CONTRACTOR MUST BE IN RECEIPT OF AN AUTHORITY TO PROCEED CERTIFICATE. THE CERTIFICATE WILL ONLY BE ISSUED FOLLOWING A CABLE SCAN CARRIED OUT BY AN ARQIVA REPRESENTATIV
  3
E TO DETERMINE THE POSITION OF EXISTING UNDERGROUND CABLES. THE CONTRACTOR REMAINS RESPONSIBLE FOR CARRYING OUT THEIR OWN CABLE SCAN PRIOR TO AND DURING EXCAVATION. IT IS ALSO THE CONTRACTORS RESPONSIBILITY TO MAINTAIN THE MARKS DELINEATING CABLE ROU
  3
TES THROUGHOUT THE DURATION OF THE WORKS".\P\P2. CONCRETE FOR THE BASE TO BE PLACED IN ONE CONTINUOUS POUR. FORMED FINISHES TO BE BASIC FINISH / PLAIN SMOOTH FINISH. WORKED FINISH TO BE STEEL / FLOAT FINISHED.\P\P3. FINAL POSITION OF ALL DUCTS MUST B
  3
E AGREED ON SITE WITH AN ARQIVA REPRESENTATIVE. ALL DUCTS TO BE FITTED WITH ADEQUATE DRAW ROPES AND CUT AT SITE BOUNDARY.\P\P4. ALL DUCTS TO BE FOAM SEALED AFTER INSTALLATION OF ALL CABLES.\P\P5. REMOVE ALL RUBBISH AND LEAVE AREA CLEAN AND TIDY. BREA
  1
K UP LOOSE SOIL LUMPS AND REMOVE LARGE STONES FROM SITE TO ALLOW FOR GRASS CUTTING. TRIM TREES WHERE NECESSARY.
